# 🏪 LocalSampark — Complete Shop Directory Multi-Role Management System

## Executive Summary

This plan transforms the LocalSampark shop directory from its current state (partially-connected dashboards with dummy data, 11 of 39 categories having manager components, disconnected visitor/owner/delivery flows) into a **fully integrated, role-aware management system** spanning **39 shop categories**, **8 user roles**, and the **complete visitor-to-delivery lifecycle** — on both Web (Next.js) and Mobile (React Native/Expo).

---

## Current State Analysis (Deep Research Findings)

### What Exists Today

| Layer | Status | Details |
|-------|--------|---------|
| **39 Shop Categories** | ✅ Seeded in DB | 11 Product · 22 Appointment · 4 Hybrid — all with commission, convenience fee, registration fields |
| **Shop Routes (Backend)** | ✅ 621 lines | Register, products, services, staff, appointments, orders, batch checkout, reviews, Q&A, flash sales |
| **Shop Dashboard (Web)** | ⚠️ 13 components | RetailManager, BeautyManager, HospitalManager, GarageManager, etc. — **all use dummy/mock data, NOT connected to backend APIs** |
| **Shop Dashboard (Mobile)** | ⚠️ ShopDashboard.js | Basic order list only — no category-specific management |
| **Visitor Flow (Web)** | ⚠️ Partial | Shop directory + category filter + checkout — but **no appointment booking UI, no service request flow, no walk-in QR** |
| **Visitor Flow (Mobile)** | ⚠️ Basic | Shop list only — no detail page, no cart, no checkout |
| **Delivery System** | ✅ Functional | Job creation, agent dispatch (Haversine + OSRM), OTP verification, wallet/analytics — but **no real-time GPS tracking UI** |
| **Admin Dashboard** | ✅ 11 sections | Approvals, commissions, revenue, franchises, users, categories, settings — **but no category-specific monitoring** |
| **Territory Admin** | ✅ Routes exist | Approvals hub, dashboard stats, region-scoped — **but no shop performance analytics** |
