## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Category Grouping Strategy**: Rather than building 39 separate manager components, the plan groups categories into **7 Management Archetypes** (see below). Each archetype handles a family of related categories. Please confirm this grouping approach before we proceed.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Mobile Scope**: The plan covers both Web (Next.js) and Mobile (React Native). The mobile changes will modify files in `mobile_build/mobile_build 07-07-2026/src/`. Confirm this is the correct target for mobile changes.

> [!WARNING]
> **Breaking Change — Order State Machine**: The current order states will be extended with `return_requested → returned → refunded` and `disputed → resolved`. Existing orders with status `delivered` or `cancelled` will remain unaffected.

