## Open Questions

> [!IMPORTANT]
> 1. **Payment Gateway**: Razorpay keys are mock (`rzp_test_mockkey`). Should we integrate real Razorpay test keys for appointment payments, or keep the mock for now?
> 2. **Push Notifications**: Should we integrate Firebase Cloud Messaging (FCM) for real push notifications, or use only in-app socket notifications?
> 3. **Image Uploads**: Shop photos, product images, and service images currently reference URLs. Should we add Cloudinary/S3 upload integration, or keep URL-based references?
> 4. **SMS/WhatsApp**: Should OTP delivery and order notifications use actual SMS/WhatsApp APIs (MSG91, Twilio), or remain console-logged?

