#### [NEW] backend/src/migrations/016_shop_management_upgrade.sqlite.sql

New database migration adding:
- `shop_orders` extended states: `return_requested`, `returned`, `refunded`, `disputed`, `resolved`
- `shop_disputes` table: dispute ID, order/appointment ref, initiator (visitor/owner), category, description, resolution, admin notes
- `shop_returns` table: return request, reason, approval status, pickup scheduling
- `shop_notifications` table: recipient_id, type, title, body, data JSON, read status, created_at
- `shop_chat_messages` table: shop_id, sender_id, receiver_id, message, type (text/image/system), read_at
- `shop_walkin_scans` table: shop_id, visitor_id, scanned_at, source (qr/nfc)
- `shop_owner_payouts` table: payout_id, shop_id, amount, period, status, settled_at, bank_ref
- `visitor_order_history` view: unified view of orders + appointments per user
- Alter `shop_appointments` add `check_in_status`, `no_show`, `reschedule_count`
- Alter `local_shops` add `management_archetype` TEXT (auto-derived from category)

