**Order State Machine Enhancement**:
```
pending → accepted → preparing → ready_for_pickup → dispatched → delivered
                                                                    ↓
                                                         return_requested → returned → refunded
                                                                    ↓
                                                              disputed → resolved
cancelled (from any pre-delivered state)
```

